codex
The key conclusion is now stable: two merges are defensible, but only after correcting an internal scope mismatch in the plan. The 15-row spine separates baseline work from checker work, while the detailed S1a section still assigns both to S1a; that must be resolved or the nominal two-week cadence is not credible.
